  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">gene-xpert<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-gene-xpert\"> </a></td><td>GeneXpert</td><td>Testing performed using a GeneXpert platform.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">m-pima<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-m-pima\"> </a></td><td>m-PIMA</td><td>Testing performed using an m-PIMA platform.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">conventional-pcr<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-conventional-pcr\"> </a></td><td>Conventional PCR laboratory</td><td>Testing performed using a conventional PCR laboratory platform. The source SOP also prints 'PCR LaC'.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-1\"> </a></td><td>Devolved</td><td>Source register DSD status code 1: devolved.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-2\"> </a></td><td>Non-devolved</td><td>Source register DSD status code 2: non-devolved.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">3<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-3\"> </a></td><td>Not eligible for devolvement</td><td>Source register DSD status code 3: not eligible for devolvement.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-undetectable-or-le-50<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-vl-undetectable-or-le-50\"> </a></td><td>Target not detected or 50 copies/mL or less</td><td>Source A34 category: undetectable or no more than 50 copies/mL.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-suppressed-detectable<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-vl-suppressed-detectable\"> </a></td><td>Suppressed but detectable</td><td>Source A35 category: greater than 50 and no more than 1000 copies/mL.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">vl-unsuppressed<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-vl-unsuppressed\"> </a></td><td>Unsuppressed</td><td>Source A36 category: greater than 1000 copies/mL.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">routine<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-routine\"> </a></td><td>Routine viral-load monitoring</td><td>Routine viral-load monitoring.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">targeted<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-targeted\"> </a></td><td>Targeted viral-load monitoring</td><td>Viral-load testing prompted by a clinical, immunological, pregnancy, post-EAC, recent-infection or early-detection indication.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">male-under-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-male-under-1\"> </a></td><td>Male, younger than 1 year</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">male-1-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-male-1-4\"> </a></td><td>Male, 1–4 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">male-5-9<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-male-5-9\"> </a></td><td>Male, 5–9 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">male-10-14<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-male-10-14\"> </a></td><td>Male, 10–14 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">male-15-19<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-male-15-19\"> </a></td><td>Male, 15–19 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">male-20-24<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-male-20-24\"> </a></td><td>Male, 20–24 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">male-25-49<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-male-25-49\"> </a></td><td>Male, 25–49 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">male-50-plus<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-male-50-plus\"> </a></td><td>Male, 50 years or older</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">female-under-1<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-female-under-1\"> </a></td><td>Female, younger than 1 year</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">female-1-4<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-female-1-4\"> </a></td><td>Female, 1–4 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">female-5-9<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-female-5-9\"> </a></td><td>Female, 5–9 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">female-10-14<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-female-10-14\"> </a></td><td>Female, 10–14 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">female-15-19<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-female-15-19\"> </a></td><td>Female, 15–19 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">female-20-24<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-female-20-24\"> </a></td><td>Female, 20–24 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">female-25-49<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-female-25-49\"> </a></td><td>Female, 25–49 years</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">female-50-plus<a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-register-cs-female-50-plus\"> </a></td><td>Female, 50 years or older</td><td/></tr></table></div>"
